**Execution timing:**

```code
import functools, time
def timed(func):
    @functools.wraps(func)
    def wrapper(*args, **kwargs):
        start = time.perf_counter()
        try:
            return func(*args, **kwargs)
        finally:
            elapsed = time.perf_counter() - start
            print(f"[timed] {func.__name__} took {elapsed:.2f}s")
    return wrapper
