Every cell needs its own executor; on hardware, every cell would need its own device. A matrix over boards is only valid with one lockable resource per cell.

| Approach | Needs | Notes |
| agent { docker { image | Docker Pipeline plugin, Docker | Jenkins mounts the workspace |
| on agent | and runs steps inside | 'python:3.13-slim' } } |
| agent { dockerfile true } | same | builds the repo’s Dockerfile first |
| Approach | Needs | Notes |
| Docker CLI on agent | most explicit; you manage | sh 'docker run …' mounts and exit codes |
| Kubernetes pod agents | Kubernetes plugin + cluster | each build gets a fresh pod |

